              "text": "Depending on the context, **\"Chase Capital Services\"** can refer to a few different financial entities or services. The most common meanings include:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Chase Capital Services (P) Ltd (India)\nThis is an established private financial advisory firm based in India. \n* **Background:** Founded in 1997 and headquartered in Mohali (Punjab/Chandigarh), it is registered under the Ministry of Corporate Affairs in India.\n* **Core Services:** The company provides a range of corporate financial solutions, including:\n  * **Debt Syndication:** Helping businesses secure loans and structured debt from a syndicate of lenders.\n  * **Project Consultancy:** Offering strategic planning and financial analysis for major projects.\n  * **Securitization Services:** Assisting in transforming illiquid assets into security instruments.\n  * **Currency and Commodity Trading:** Executing trades and managing hedging solutions on recognized exchanges.\n  * **Corporate Advisory & Investment Banking:** Managing back-office, administrative, and IPO-related advisory services for mid-sized enterprises.\n\n---\n\n### 2. JPMorgan Chase & Co. (Business Capital & Commercial Banking)\nIf you are in the United States or looking for the major multinational bank, \"Chase Capital Services\" often refers colloquially to the business lending and capital divisions of **JPMorgan Chase**.\n* **Chase Capital:** JPMorgan Chase operates a structured debt and equity business specifically under the name **Chase Capital**. It provides alternative financing solutions and junior capital (such as mezzanine debt and minority equity) to mid-sized businesses.\n* **Chase Business & Commercial Banking Services:** For everyday businesses, Chase offers services designed to help companies access capital, manage cash flow, and scale. This includes:\n  * Small business loans and lines of credit.\n  * Equipment and commercial real estate financing.\n  * Merchant services (payment processing).\n  * Global treasury, payment solutions, and international capital markets.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Safety Alert: \"Chase Capital Online\" (Potential Scam)\nIf you are looking up this name because you were contacted by an online entity or broker, be cautious. \n* **FCA Warning:** In 2022, the UK's Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) issued an official warning regarding an unauthorized firm operating under the name **Chase Capital Online** (using the domain `chasecapitalonline.com`). \n* This entity is registered in St. Vincent and the Grenadines, has **no relation** to JPMorgan Chase, and is not authorized to sell or promote financial services. If you have been approached by this website or brokers claiming to represent them, it is highly recommended to avoid sending them funds.\n\n***\n\n**Which of these were you looking for?** If you have a specific question about an investment, a business loan, or verifying a business offer, feel free to reply with more details.",
